# `.gitignore` has no bearing on a build context, so the paths it leaves untracked
# (local secrets, the local Caddyfile, persisted data) would otherwise reach the daemon.
# A new COPY from the build context needs a matching `!` re-include here.
*
!Caddyfile.example
!Caddyfile.plugins.example
!alerts.yaml
!tests/
